  "notes": "Compound of {分|ぶん} (to divide) + {裂|れつ} (to tear, to rip). Carries a stronger, more negative connotation than {分割|ぶんかつ}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {分裂|ぶんれつ}する (to split, to divide)\n- {政党|せいとう}の{分裂|ぶんれつ} (party split)\n- {細胞|さいぼう}{分裂|ぶんれつ} (cell division)\n- {核|かく}{分裂|ぶんれつ} (nuclear fission)\n- {分裂|ぶんれつ}{状態|じょうたい} (state of division)\n- {国|くに}の{分裂|ぶんれつ} (national division)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {分裂|ぶんれつ}: splitting apart with conflict or natural force; often negative\n- {分割|ぶんかつ}: deliberate, controlled division into parts\n- {分離|ぶんり}: separation of connected elements; more neutral",
